 558:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  * \param[in] address The address or identifier of the performance counter to be read. Range: 0 to 
 559:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  *
