 110:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/_Lib/DataHandling/Ifx_Fifo.h ****  *
 111:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/_Lib/DataHandling/Ifx_Fifo.h ****  * \return returns a pointer to the FIFO object
