 128:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/_Lib/DataHandling/Ifx_Fifo.h **** /** \brief Initialize the FIFO buffer object
 129:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/_Lib/DataHandling/Ifx_Fifo.h ****  *
 130:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/_Lib/DataHandling/Ifx_Fifo.h ****  * \param buffer Specifies the FIFO object address.
 131:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/_Lib/DataHandling/Ifx_Fifo.h ****  * \param size Specifies the FIFO buffer size in bytes
 132:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/_Lib/DataHandling/Ifx_Fifo.h ****  * \param elementSize Specifies data element size in bytes. size must be bigger or equal to elemenn
 133:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/_Lib/DataHandling/Ifx_Fifo.h ****  *
 134:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/_Lib/DataHandling/Ifx_Fifo.h ****  * \return Returns a pointer on the FIFO object
 135:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/_Lib/DataHandling/Ifx_Fifo.h ****  *
 136:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/_Lib/DataHandling/Ifx_Fifo.h ****  * \note: The buffer parameter must point on a free memory location where the
 137:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/_Lib/DataHandling/Ifx_Fifo.h ****  * buffer object will be initialised. The size of this area must be at least
 138:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/_Lib/DataHandling/Ifx_Fifo.h ****  * equals to "size + sizeof(Ifx_Fifo) + 8". Not taking this in account may result
